        <mxCell id="evidence" value="evidence: docs/verify/1108 — 15/15 checks on a real daemon with a gated stub LLM (cap=2, three pinned turns: two run in parallel — canon lines (1 running) / (2 running), the third queues at position 1, claimed seconds after the first slot frees)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
